{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f57a3e42e6e5b63ee728fd18ed514c19.poster.avif?t=1755330723\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f57a3e42e6e5b63ee728fd18ed514c19.webm?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f57a3e42e6e5b63ee728fd18ed514c19.mp4?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a desperate letter from his friend Reiko asking for help, Kaito travels to the village of Nemunai. He discovers that a spiral-shaped curse envelops everything, distorting reality. Kaito must uncover the truth behind it all and escape before he is trapped forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/2f789a4a0bf0eaf7dbabe8fec39f5ef6.poster.avif?t=1755330723\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/2f789a4a0bf0eaf7dbabe8fec39f5ef6.webm?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/2f789a4a0bf0eaf7dbabe8fec39f5ef6.mp4?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the enigmatic village of Nemunai in depth with forgotten classic mechanics. Step into Kaito's shoes and traverse each of its areas, searching for the path that will lead you into the nightmares you will gradually delve into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/09ef5e44e4b154c7cd4639b35b4bd844.poster.avif?t=1755330723\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/09ef5e44e4b154c7cd4639b35b4bd844.webm?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/09ef5e44e4b154c7cd4639b35b4bd844.mp4?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate every corner, collect key items and solve puzzles to uncover the mysteries lurking behind the curse, a force that manifests itself in disturbing spirals scattered throughout the environment. As you progress, this curse will become more intense and complex, testing your ingenuity and endurance to prevent Kaito from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/87fe52edef5c46fc66dac016f3d47c1d.poster.avif?t=1755330723\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/87fe52edef5c46fc66dac016f3d47c1d.webm?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/87fe52edef5c46fc66dac016f3d47c1d.mp4?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hostile entities in unexpected ways with a combat system inspired by classic fighting games. Master combinations, blocks and counterattacks, adapting to increasingly dangerous enemies. Some you can avoid... but others you'll have to face head-on if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cA project made possible thanks to Kickstarter and its incredible community.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/4ee3bebfe70df83cf7e2b021b91558a5.avif?t=1755330723\" width=591 height=327 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903740?t=1755330723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/3e2d0e19b5d17eaa8ad14f90fe01d35fdb1c5550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755330723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/a0549892e7f47fe3338e79ced518916b3ad7e81b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755330723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/a0549892e7f47fe3338e79ced518916b3ad7e81b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755330723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f57a3e42e6e5b63ee728fd18ed514c19.poster.avif?t=1755330723\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/f57a3e42e6e5b63ee728fd18ed514c19.webm?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/e