vestigate every corner, collect key items and solve puzzles to uncover the mysteries lurking behind the curse, a force that manifests itself in disturbing spirals scattered throughout the environment. As you progress, this curse will become more intense and complex, testing your ingenuity and endurance to prevent Kaito from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/87fe52edef5c46fc66dac016f3d47c1d.poster.avif?t=1755330723\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/87fe52edef5c46fc66dac016f3d47c1d.webm?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/87fe52edef5c46fc66dac016f3d47c1d.mp4?t=1755330723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hostile entities in unexpected ways with a combat system inspired by classic fighting games. Master combinations, blocks and counterattacks, adapting to increasingly dangerous enemies. Some you can avoid... but others you'll have to face head-on if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cA project made possible thanks to Kickstarter and its incredible community.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/extras/4ee3bebfe70df83cf7e2b021b91558a5.avif?t=1755330723\" width=591 height=327 /></span></p>","developers":["DavMY Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903740/71a85fd6bd52a0170b3cdffa8bfbcee39a788a43/header.jpg?t=1755330723